source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-24
observed: A backslash written as a character reference stays the reference: the title resolves none, so the reader sees `&#92;` rather than a backslash.
-- input.jira --
[x|http://x|t&#92;u]
-- rendered.html --
<p><a href="http://x" title="t&amp;#92;u" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">x</a></p>
-- want.md --
[x](http://x "t&amp;#92;u")
-- warnings.json --
[]
